1
00:00:00,227 --> 00:00:03,427
(Penny:)I know. Then you'll finally stop
talking about it!

2
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:05,430
(Howard:)Ready to go?
Let's do this.

3
00:00:05,432 --> 00:00:06,582
Have fun, guys!

4
00:00:06,586 --> 00:00:08,766
(Leonard:)We will.
I can't believe Sheldon gave this up.

5
00:00:08,769 --> 00:00:09,459
(Caption:)I know.

6
00:00:09,482 --> 00:00:11,442
(Leonard:)We're gonna have
so much more fun than him.

7
00:00:14,141 --> 00:00:16,711
(singsongy):
No, they're not.

8
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:20,110
(Penny:)Knowing them, they will.

9
00:00:21,281 --> 00:00:23,481
(indistinct chatter)

10
00:00:24,318 --> 00:00:26,918
T minus 15 minutes!

11
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:28,220
(Raj:)Oh, did you hear
from Wil?

12
00:00:28,221 --> 00:00:30,591
(Leonard:)Yeah, he's on his way.
Time for bladder check.

13
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:31,990
(Sheldon:)Check.

14
00:00:31,992 --> 00:00:33,262
(Sheldon:)Check.

15
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:35,830
(Howard:)Check. Wait.

16
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:39,000
(Howard:)Screw it. I'm holding it.

17
00:00:38,999 --> 00:00:40,329
(crowd booing)

18
00:00:40,334 --> 00:00:42,104
(Raj:)What is everyone
booing at?

19
00:00:42,102 --> 00:00:44,302
(booing continues)

20
00:00:48,709 --> 00:00:50,209
(Wil:)Hey, guys. What's up?

21
00:00:51,311 --> 00:00:53,541
(Leonard:)Um, hey, Wil.
What you doin'?

22
00:00:53,547 --> 00:00:56,717
I was on Star Trek. I'm just
rooting for the home team.

23
00:00:56,717 --> 00:00:58,517
MAN:
Star Trek stinks!

24
00:00:58,518 --> 00:01:04,028
(Wil:)Yeah? Live long
and suck it!

